app ui-arena-board "1.0.0"
"2D real-time arena skirmish: thin organism composing headless std mechanic atoms (grid-tactics unit authority, fx-particles, round-flow, score, anim-tick) on one [runtime, shared] GameState with a single canvas-2d render authority. A 2-second clock drives the raider chase; the player commands a two-marine fireteam — select, move, focus-fire — around impassable crate debris. Down both raiders to win; lose both marines and the arena falls."
;; @capabilities "arena skirmish, squad command, real-time tactics, grid combat"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the PLAYER — Sergeant Mara Voss, commanding a two-marine
;; fireteam holding an 8x8 crash-site arena against two raider scavengers.
;; Statuses verified 2026-07-30 by a scripted full playthrough driving the
;; real game on the runtime-verify catalog through window.__orbitalVerification
;; (events in, canvas drawables + HUD DOM + bus event log out).
;;
;; THE GENRE (what an arena-skirmish player expects): play is CONTINUOUS —
;; there is no End Turn button. A 2-second clock pulses the arena: every cycle
;; each living raider steps (diagonally) toward the nearest living marine and
;; melees anything adjacent for 1, and your spent marines refresh on the same
;; pulse. Your agency is the fireteam: click a marine (cyan ring, green reach
;; cells), click a lit cell to move (walk animation), the marine STAYS
;; selected and auto-arms (red = raiders inside rifle range 2), click a lit
;; raider to shoot for 2 — then the marine is SPENT (dimmed) until the next
;; clock pulse. Four cargo crates of crash debris — (0,3),(7,4),(4,0),(3,7) —
;; are impassable for both sides: raiders beeline with no pathfinding (one
;; diagonal step per pulse, the atom's documented chase), so a crate parked
;; exactly on a raider's line stalls it until your marine repositions — that
;; is the cover game. You win when both raiders are down; you lose when both
;; marines are down. Kills tick Score +10.
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; PLAYER — "I command my fireteam: pick ground, focus fire, and kite the
;; raiders around the crates before they run my marines down."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see the whole arena framed on screen — terrain
;;      under every cell (stone floor marking the 4x4 arena center), four
;;      cargo crates of debris ground-anchored on impassable cells, my
;;      marines Reyes(1,6) and Okafor(2,6) in the south, raiders Scab(6,0)
;;      and Rizz(7,2) in the north-east corner, and the HUD showing
;;      Result/Phase/Turn/Score reading none/observation with Score 0.
;;        WORKS — 4 units at boot, marines at (1,6),(2,6), raiders in the
;;        north-east; 64 terrain sprites (16 stone); 4 crate features
;;        ground-anchored 1x1 on (0,3),(7,4),(4,0),(3,7); HUD
;;        none/observation; every unit descriptor svg/flat CDN.
;;   2. Every unit is a visible sprite with a name label and a health bar I
;;      can read at a glance — marine and raider art visually distinct,
;;      idling in place on a 4-frame breathing cycle.
;;        WORKS — all 4 units on cycling idle frames (probe: idle-0 -> 1 ->
;;        2 -> 3 -> 0 across 300ms samples), health bars full (frac 1.0),
;;        name labels drawn.
;;   3. Play is continuous: the Turn counter advances about every 2 seconds
;;      WITHOUT me touching anything, AI_TURN rides the bus, the raiders
;;      close the distance on their own — and a marine I spent last cycle is
;;      selectable again on the next.
;;        WORKS — Turn 3 -> 5 in ~4.6s with zero input; AI_TURN on the bus;
;;        raider distance to the marines shrank 7 -> 2; a spent marine was
;;        selectable again next cycle.
;;   4. Select: I click a marine — cyan ring on her, phase=selection, and
;;      green reach cells light her range-2 diamond MINUS the crate cells
;;      and her squadmate's cell. CANCEL clears everything back to
;;      observation.
;;        WORKS — select lit the cyan ring + 7 green reach cells (range-2
;;        diamond minus the squadmate's cell; crates never lit); CANCEL ->
;;        observation, zero lit cells.
;;   5. Move: I click a green cell — she walks (walk animation), the marine
;;      STAYS selected and auto-arms (phase=action, red on raiders inside
;;      rifle range 2 from the NEW cell). A second move in the same cycle
;;      is a dead click (guard).
;;        WORKS — walk anim played; p1 (1,6)->(1,5); phase=action; second
;;        TILE_CLICK denied (position unchanged).
;;   6. Attack: I click a raider inside the red — the shot lands for 2
;;      (health bar drops), BURST "-2" rides the bus with a hit effect
;;      sprite on the target, attack anim on the shooter / hit anim on the
;;      target, and the shooter is dimmed spent until the next pulse.
;;        WORKS — e1 frac 1.00->0.50; BURST "-2" + hit.svg painted; attack/
;;        hit anims seen; shooter opacity 0.45 and not re-selectable.
;;   7. The raiders never stop: every pulse they step diagonally toward the
;;      nearest marine, NEVER enter a crate cell, and a raider standing
;;      adjacent melees my marine for 1 (BURST "-1" fx on her).
;;        WORKS — raiders closed every pulse; no raider ever occupied
;;        (0,3),(7,4),(4,0),(3,7); adjacent raider dealt 1 (BURST "-1").
;;   8. Kills pay: a raider at 0 health renders his death frame where he
;;      fell and Score ticks +10 on the HUD.
;;        WORKS — death frame on both kills; Score 0 -> 10 -> 20.
;;   9. When both raiders are down I win — Result flips to victory, GAME_END
;;      rides the bus, and the board freezes (further clicks are dead).
;;        WORKS — result=victory; GAME_END emitted; post-game UNIT_CLICK
;;        left phase=observation with zero lit cells.
;;  10. And if I never give an order, the arena runs my marines down: a
;;      fresh session with zero input ends Result=defeat with GAME_END once
;;      the raiders close and melee both marines to 0.
;;        WORKS — idle session reached result=defeat with GAME_END at ~38s.
;;
;; MULTIPLAYER NOTE: GameState is [runtime, shared], so every connected
;; client watches the same skirmish; intents serialize through the server
;; authority. There is no per-seat ownership — any client can command any
;; marine.
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/, generated by tools/asset-workflow
;; svg-generator from the sibling .md descriptions)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/ground.svg full-cell flat tiles; terrain/stone.svg
;;             marks the 4x4 arena-center floor (16 tiles).
;;   Units     units/{marine,raider}.svg + animation frames
;;             .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1, attack-0, hit-0, death-0}.svg; the
;;             render layer url-rewrites name.svg -> name.<anim>-<i>.svg.
;;             player: p1 Reyes marine 8hp (1,6)   p2 Okafor marine 8hp (2,6)
;;             enemy:  e1 Scab raider 4hp (6,0)    e2 Rizz raider 4hp (7,2)
;;   Features  features/crate.svg x4 at (0,3),(7,4),(4,0),(3,7) — crash
;;             debris on impassable cells (matching tiles passable: false).
;;   Effects   effects/hit.svg (BURST "hit" fx), effects/explosion.svg
;;             (manifest-only).
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg = game-shell background + HUD panel.
;; ============================================================================

orbital ArenaBoardOrbital {
  uses Tactics from "std/behaviors/std-grid-tactics"
  uses Particles from "std/behaviors/std-fx-particles"
  uses Round from "std/behaviors/std-round-flow"
  uses Score from "std/behaviors/std-score"
  uses AnimTick from "std/behaviors/std-anim-tick"

  type Asset = {
    url : asset
    atlas : asset
    sprite : string
    role : string
    category : string
    animations : [string]
    style : string
    dimension : string
    aspect : string
    name : string
    thumbnailUrl : string
  }
  type Unit = {
    id : string!
    position : { x : number!  y : number! }
    x : number
    y : number
    z : number
    team : string
    health : number
    maxHealth : number
    unitType : string
    name : string
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type Tile = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    terrain : string
    passable : boolean
  }
  type Fx = {
    id : string!
    type : string!
    x : number!
    z : number
    y : number
    message : string
    ttl : number!
  }
  type ValidMove = { x : number!  z : number! }
  type Feature = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    type : string
    assetUrl : Asset
  }
  type AssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }

  entity GameState [runtime, shared] {
    id : string!
    units : [Unit] = [ { id: "p1", position: { x: 1, y: 6 }, x: 1, y: 6, z: 0, team: "player", health: 8, maxHealth: 8, unitType: "marine", name: "Reyes", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "p2", position: { x: 2, y: 6 }, x: 2, y: 6, z: 0, team: "player", health: 8, maxHealth: 8, unitType: "marine", name: "Okafor", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e1", position: { x: 6, y: 0 }, x: 6, y: 0, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 4, maxHealth: 4, unitType: "raider", name: "Scab", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e2", position: { x: 7, y: 2 }, x: 7, y: 2, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 4, maxHealth: 4, unitType: "raider", name: "Rizz", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
    fx : [Fx] = []
    tiles : [Tile] = [ { id: "t-0-0", x: 0, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-0", x: 1, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-0", x: 2, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-0", x: 3, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-0", x: 4, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-5-0", x: 5, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-0", x: 6, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-0", x: 7, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-1", x: 0, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-1", x: 1, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-1", x: 2, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-1", x: 3, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-1", x: 4, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-1", x: 5, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-1", x: 6, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-1", x: 7, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-2", x: 0, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-2", x: 1, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-2", x: 2, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-2", x: 3, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-2", x: 4, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-2", x: 5, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-2", x: 6, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-2", x: 7, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-3", x: 0, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-3", x: 1, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-3", x: 2, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-3", x: 3, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-3", x: 4, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-3", x: 5, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-3", x: 6, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-3", x: 7, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-4", x: 0, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-4", x: 1, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-4", x: 2, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-4", x: 3, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-4", x: 4, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-4", x: 5, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-4", x: 6, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-4", x: 7, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-5", x: 0, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-5", x: 1, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-5", x: 2, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-5", x: 3, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-5", x: 4, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-5", x: 5, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-5", x: 6, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-5", x: 7, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-6", x: 0, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-6", x: 1, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-6", x: 2, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-6", x: 3, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-6", x: 4, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-6", x: 5, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-6", x: 6, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-6", x: 7, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-7", x: 0, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-7", x: 1, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-7", x: 2, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-7", x: 3, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-7", x: 4, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-7", x: 5, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-7", x: 6, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-7", x: 7, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true } ]
    result : string = "none"
    score : number = 0
    scoreBaseline : number = 0
    animCounter : number = 0
    frameName : string = "0"
    selectedUnitId : string = ""
    validMoves : [ValidMove] = []
    attackTargets : [ValidMove] = []
    movedIds : [string] = []
    actedIds : [string] = []
    uiPhase : string = "observation"
    turn : number = 0
    clockTicks : number = 0
    animUnitId : string = ""
    animState : string = "idle"
    animTicksLeft : number = 0
    animAttackerId : string = ""
    animAtkTicksLeft : number = 0
  }

  trait TacticsAuthority = Tactics.traits.GridTactics -> GameState {
    config {
      running: true
      gridWidth: 8
      gridHeight: 8
      attackDamage: 2
      units: [ { id: "p1", position: { x: 1, y: 6 }, x: 1, y: 6, z: 0, team: "player", health: 8, maxHealth: 8, unitType: "marine", name: "Reyes", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "p2", position: { x: 2, y: 6 }, x: 2, y: 6, z: 0, team: "player", health: 8, maxHealth: 8, unitType: "marine", name: "Okafor", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e1", position: { x: 6, y: 0 }, x: 6, y: 0, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 4, maxHealth: 4, unitType: "raider", name: "Scab", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "e2", position: { x: 7, y: 2 }, x: 7, y: 2, z: 0, team: "enemy", health: 4, maxHealth: 4, unitType: "raider", name: "Rizz", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
      tiles: [ { id: "t-0-0", x: 0, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-0", x: 1, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-0", x: 2, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-0", x: 3, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-0", x: 4, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-5-0", x: 5, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-0", x: 6, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-0", x: 7, y: 0, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-1", x: 0, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-1", x: 1, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-1", x: 2, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-1", x: 3, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-1", x: 4, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-1", x: 5, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-1", x: 6, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-1", x: 7, y: 1, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-2", x: 0, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-2", x: 1, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-2", x: 2, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-2", x: 3, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-2", x: 4, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-2", x: 5, y: 2, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-2", x: 6, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-2", x: 7, y: 2, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-3", x: 0, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-1-3", x: 1, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-3", x: 2, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-3", x: 3, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-3", x: 4, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-3", x: 5, y: 3, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-3", x: 6, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-3", x: 7, y: 3, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-4", x: 0, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-4", x: 1, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-4", x: 2, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-4", x: 3, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-4", x: 4, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-4", x: 5, y: 4, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-4", x: 6, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-4", x: 7, y: 4, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-0-5", x: 0, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-5", x: 1, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-5", x: 2, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-5", x: 3, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-5", x: 4, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-5", x: 5, y: 5, terrain: "stone", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-5", x: 6, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-5", x: 7, y: 5, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-6", x: 0, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-6", x: 1, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-6", x: 2, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-6", x: 3, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-4-6", x: 4, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-6", x: 5, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-6", x: 6, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-6", x: 7, y: 6, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-0-7", x: 0, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-1-7", x: 1, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-2-7", x: 2, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-3-7", x: 3, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: false }, { id: "t-4-7", x: 4, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-5-7", x: 5, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-6-7", x: 6, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true }, { id: "t-7-7", x: 7, y: 7, terrain: "ground", passable: true } ]
    }
  }

  trait FxDecay = Particles.traits.FxParticles -> GameState {
    config { running: true }
  }

  trait RoundLogic = Round.traits.RoundFlow -> GameState {
    config { running: true }
  }

  trait ScoreKeeper = Score.traits.ScoreKeeper -> GameState {
    config { running: true, pointsPerKill: 10, startScore: 0, initialEnemies: 2 }
  }

  trait AnimClock = AnimTick.traits.AnimTick -> GameState {
    config { frames: [] }
  }

  trait ArenaClock -> @rebindable GameState [lifecycle] {
    initial: running

    state running {
      INIT -> running
        (set @entity.clockTicks 0)
    }

    ticks {
      arenaTick every 2000ms when (== @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.clockTicks (+ @entity.clockTicks 1))
        (emit AI_TURN { turn: @entity.clockTicks })
    }

    emits {
      AI_TURN -> external {
        turn : number
      }
        @description "Real-time skirmish pulse: the grid-tactics authority runs the raider chase/melee pipeline and the command trait refreshes spent marines"
        @tier "domain"
    }
  }

  trait ArenaCommand -> GameState [interaction, instance] {
    initial: playing

    state playing {
      INIT -> playing
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.attackTargets [])
        (set @entity.movedIds [])
        (set @entity.actedIds [])
        (set @entity.uiPhase "observation")
        (set @entity.turn 0)
        (set @entity.animUnitId "")
        (set @entity.animState "idle")
        (set @entity.animTicksLeft 0)
        (set @entity.animAttackerId "")
        (set @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0)
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: @config.backgroundAsset
          hudBackgroundAsset: @config.hudBackgroundAsset
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Result", value: @entity.result, format: "text" }, { label: "Phase", value: @entity.uiPhase, format: "text" }, { label: "Turn", value: @entity.turn }, { label: "Score", value: @entity.score } ] }
          addons: { type: stack, direction: vertical, gap: sm, children: [ { type: button, action: CANCEL, label: "Cancel", variant: secondary } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, projection: @config.projection, showMinimap: @config.showMinimap, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.tiles (fn t { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, fill: "#1f2937", stroke: "rgba(255,255,255,0.12)", strokeWidth: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest terrains) (object/get @t terrain)), anchor: "center", width: 1, height: 1 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m z) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.attackTargets (fn a { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @a x), y: (object/get @a z) }, fill: "rgba(239,68,68,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAsset (if (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (object/get @u modelUrl) (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest units) (object/get @u unitType)))) (unitUrl (object/get @unitAsset url)) (unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u health) 0) "death" (if (and (== (object/get @u id) @entity.animAttackerId) (> @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0)) "attack" (if (== (object/get @u id) @entity.animUnitId) @entity.animState "idle"))))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), asset: (if (and @unitUrl (str/includes @unitUrl ".svg")) (object/merge @unitAsset { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split @unitUrl ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat (if (== @unitAnim "walk") (% @entity.animCounter 2) (if (== @unitAnim "idle") (% (math/floor (/ @entity.animCounter 3)) 4) 0))) ".svg")))) }) @unitAsset), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, opacity: (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.actedIds (fn aid (== @aid (object/get @u id))))) 0) 0.45 1) }))) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), anchor: "ground", offsetX: -0.25, offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.5, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), anchor: "ground", offsetX: -0.25, offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.5 (/ (object/get @u health) (object/get @u maxHealth))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.fx (fn f { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @f message), position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f z) }, color: "#ffe066" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.fx (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f z) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f type)), anchor: "center", width: 0.6, height: 0.6 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter (array/flatten (array/map @entity.units (fn u (array/flatten (array/map [ ["idle", 4], ["walk", 2], ["attack", 1], ["hit", 1], ["death", 1] ] (fn st (array/map (array/range 0 (array/nth @st 1)) (fn i (if (and (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg")) (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat (array/nth @st 0) (str/concat "-" (str/concat @i ".svg"))))) ""))))))))) (fn w (!= @w ""))) (fn warmUrl { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, asset: { url: @warmUrl }, opacity: 0, width: 0.5, height: 0.5 })) }
          ] } ]
        })

      UNIT_CLICK -> playing when (and (== @entity.result "none") (and (!= @entity.selectedUnitId "") (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.actedIds (fn aid (== @aid @entity.selectedUnitId)))) 0) (and (== (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) team) "enemy") (and (> (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) health) 0) (<= (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id @entity.selectedUnitId))) position) (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) position)) @config.attackRange))))))
        (emit ATTACK { targetId: ?unitId })
        (set @entity.actedIds (array/append @entity.actedIds @entity.selectedUnitId))
        (set @entity.animAttackerId @entity.selectedUnitId)
        (set @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 4)
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.attackTargets [])
        (set @entity.uiPhase "observation")

      UNIT_CLICK -> playing when (and (== @entity.result "none") (== @entity.selectedUnitId ?unitId))
        (set @entity.uiPhase "action")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.attackTargets (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (and (> @u.health 0) (<= (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn s (== @s.id @entity.selectedUnitId))) position) (object/get @u position)) @config.attackRange))))) (fn u { x: (object/get (object/get @u position) x), z: (object/get (object/get @u position) y) })))

      UNIT_CLICK -> playing when (and (== @entity.result "none") (and (> (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) health) 0) (and (== (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) team) "player") (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.actedIds (fn aid (== @aid ?unitId)))) 0))))
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId ?unitId)
        (set @entity.uiPhase "selection")
        (set @entity.attackTargets [])
        (set @entity.validMoves (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.movedIds (fn aid (== @aid ?unitId)))) 0) [] (array/map (array/filter @entity.tiles (fn t (and (== (object/get @t passable) true) (and (<= (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id ?unitId))) position) { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }) @config.movementRange) (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (> (object/get @u health) 0) (and (== (object/get (object/get @u position) x) (object/get @t x)) (== (object/get (object/get @u position) y) (object/get @t y))))))) 0))))) (fn t { x: (object/get @t x), z: (object/get @t y) }))))

      TILE_CLICK -> playing when (and (== @entity.result "none") (and (!= @entity.selectedUnitId "") (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.movedIds (fn aid (== @aid @entity.selectedUnitId)))) 0) (and (> (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id @entity.selectedUnitId))) health) 0) (and (grid/in-bounds { x: ?x, y: ?y } @config.gridWidth @config.gridHeight) (and (<= (grid/manhattan-distance (object/get (array/find @entity.units (fn u (== @u.id @entity.selectedUnitId))) position) { x: ?x, y: ?y }) @config.movementRange) (and (== (array/len (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (> (object/get @u health) 0) (and (== (object/get (object/get @u position) x) ?x) (== (object/get (object/get @u position) y) ?y)))))) 0) (== (object/get (array/find @entity.tiles (fn t (and (== (object/get @t x) ?x) (== (object/get @t y) ?y)))) passable) true))))))))
        (emit MOVE { unitId: @entity.selectedUnitId, x: ?x, y: ?y })
        (set @entity.movedIds (array/append @entity.movedIds @entity.selectedUnitId))
        (set @entity.uiPhase "action")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.attackTargets (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (and (== @u.team "enemy") (and (> @u.health 0) (<= (grid/manhattan-distance { x: ?x, y: ?y } (object/get @u position)) @config.attackRange))))) (fn u { x: (object/get (object/get @u position) x), z: (object/get (object/get @u position) y) })))

      CANCEL -> playing when (!= @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.attackTargets [])
        (set @entity.uiPhase "observation")

      AI_TURN -> playing when (== @entity.result "none")
        (set @entity.turn (+ @entity.turn 1))
        (set @entity.movedIds [])
        (set @entity.actedIds [])
        (set @entity.selectedUnitId "")
        (set @entity.validMoves [])
        (set @entity.attackTargets [])
        (set @entity.uiPhase "observation")

      MOVE -> playing
        (set @entity.animUnitId ?unitId)
        (set @entity.animState "walk")
        (set @entity.animTicksLeft 6)

      ATTACK -> playing
        (set @entity.animUnitId ?targetId)
        (set @entity.animState "hit")
        (set @entity.animTicksLeft 4)
    }

    ticks {
      renderTick every 100ms
        (set @entity.animTicksLeft (if (> @entity.animTicksLeft 0) (- @entity.animTicksLeft 1) 0))
        (set @entity.animAtkTicksLeft (if (> @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0) (- @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 1) 0))
        (set @entity.animState (if (== @entity.animTicksLeft 0) "idle" @entity.animState))
        (set @entity.animUnitId (if (== @entity.animTicksLeft 0) "" @entity.animUnitId))
        (set @entity.animAttackerId (if (== @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0) "" @entity.animAttackerId))
        (render-ui main {
          type: game-shell
          backgroundAsset: @config.backgroundAsset
          hudBackgroundAsset: @config.hudBackgroundAsset
          hud: { type: game-hud, stats: [ { label: "Result", value: @entity.result, format: "text" }, { label: "Phase", value: @entity.uiPhase, format: "text" }, { label: "Turn", value: @entity.turn }, { label: "Score", value: @entity.score } ] }
          addons: { type: stack, direction: vertical, gap: sm, children: [ { type: button, action: CANCEL, label: "Cancel", variant: secondary } ] }
          children: [ { type: canvas, fit: true, projection: @config.projection, showMinimap: @config.showMinimap, tileClickEvent: TILE_CLICK, unitClickEvent: UNIT_CLICK, children: [
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.tiles (fn t { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, fill: "#1f2937", stroke: "rgba(255,255,255,0.12)", strokeWidth: 1 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.tiles (fn t { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @t x), y: (object/get @t y) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest terrains) (object/get @t terrain)), anchor: "center", width: 1, height: 1 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @config.features (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f y) }, asset: (object/get @f assetUrl), anchor: "ground", width: 1, height: 1 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.validMoves (fn m { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @m x), y: (object/get @m z) }, fill: "rgba(74,222,128,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map @entity.attackTargets (fn a { type: draw-shape, shape: "cell", position: { x: (object/get @a x), y: (object/get @a z) }, fill: "rgba(239,68,68,0.4)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (== (object/get @u id) @entity.selectedUnitId))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "ellipse", position: (object/get @u position), radiusX: 0.5, radiusY: 0.2, stroke: "rgba(0,200,255,0.8)", strokeWidth: 3 })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.units (fn u (let ((unitAsset (if (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (object/get @u modelUrl) (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest units) (object/get @u unitType)))) (unitUrl (object/get @unitAsset url)) (unitAnim (if (<= (object/get @u health) 0) "death" (if (and (== (object/get @u id) @entity.animAttackerId) (> @entity.animAtkTicksLeft 0)) "attack" (if (== (object/get @u id) @entity.animUnitId) @entity.animState "idle"))))) { type: draw-sprite, position: (object/get @u position), asset: (if (and @unitUrl (str/includes @unitUrl ".svg")) (object/merge @unitAsset { url: (str/concat (array/nth (str/split @unitUrl ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat @unitAnim (str/concat "-" (str/concat (if (== @unitAnim "walk") (% @entity.animCounter 2) (if (== @unitAnim "idle") (% (math/floor (/ @entity.animCounter 3)) 4) 0))) ".svg")))) }) @unitAsset), id: (object/get @u id), anchor: "ground", width: 0.5, height: 0.5, opacity: (if (> (array/len (array/filter @entity.actedIds (fn aid (== @aid (object/get @u id))))) 0) 0.45 1) }))) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), anchor: "ground", offsetX: -0.25, offsetY: -0.6, width: 0.5, height: 0.12, fill: "rgba(0,0,0,0.6)" })) }
            { type: draw-shape-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-shape, shape: "rect", position: (object/get @u position), anchor: "ground", offsetX: -0.25, offsetY: -0.6, width: (* 0.5 (/ (object/get @u health) (object/get @u maxHealth))), height: 0.12, fill: "#22c55e" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter @entity.units (fn u (> (object/get @u health) 0))) (fn u { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @u name), position: (object/get @u position), offsetY: -0.85, color: "#ffffff" })) }
            { type: draw-text-layer, items: (array/map @entity.fx (fn f { type: draw-text, text: (object/get @f message), position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f z) }, color: "#ffe066" })) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/filter (array/map @entity.fx (fn f { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: (object/get @f x), y: (object/get @f z) }, asset: (object/get (object/get @config.assetManifest effects) (object/get @f type)), anchor: "center", width: 0.6, height: 0.6 })) (fn s (object/get (object/get @s asset) url))) }
            { type: draw-sprite-layer, items: (array/map (array/filter (array/flatten (array/map @entity.units (fn u (array/flatten (array/map [ ["idle", 4], ["walk", 2], ["attack", 1], ["hit", 1], ["death", 1] ] (fn st (array/map (array/range 0 (array/nth @st 1)) (fn i (if (and (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) (str/includes (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg")) (str/concat (array/nth (str/split (object/get (object/get @u modelUrl) url) ".svg") 0) (str/concat "." (str/concat (array/nth @st 0) (str/concat "-" (str/concat @i ".svg"))))) ""))))))))) (fn w (!= @w ""))) (fn warmUrl { type: draw-sprite, position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, asset: { url: @warmUrl }, opacity: 0, width: 0.5, height: 0.5 })) }
          ] } ]
        })
    }

    emits {
      MOVE -> external {
        unitId : string!
        x : number!
        y : number!
      }
        @description "Player move intent applied by the grid-tactics authority"
        @tier "domain"
      ATTACK -> external {
        targetId : string!
      }
        @description "Player attack intent applied by the grid-tactics authority"
        @tier "domain"
      TILE_CLICK -> external {
        x : number!
        y : number!
      }
        @description "tileClickEvent prop"
        @tier "domain"
      UNIT_CLICK -> external {
        unitId : string!
      }
        @description "unitClickEvent prop"
        @tier "domain"
      CANCEL -> external {
        id : string
      }
        @description "Clears the current selection"
        @tier "domain"
    }

    listens {
      AI_TURN { turn : number }
    }

    config {
      gridWidth : number = 8
        @label "Grid Width"
        @description "Grid column count (matches TacticsAuthority.gridWidth)."
        @tier "domain"
      gridHeight : number = 8
        @label "Grid Height"
        @description "Grid row count (matches TacticsAuthority.gridHeight)."
        @tier "domain"
      movementRange : number = 2
        @label "Movement Range"
        @description "Max manhattan distance a selected marine may move per cycle."
        @tier "domain"
      attackRange : number = 2
        @label "Attack Range"
        @description "Max manhattan distance a selected marine may shoot a raider."
        @tier "domain"
      features : [Feature] = [ { id: "crate1", x: 0, y: 3, type: "crate", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/features/crate.svg", role: "decoration", category: "crate", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crate", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "crate2", x: 7, y: 4, type: "crate", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/features/crate.svg", role: "decoration", category: "crate", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crate", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "crate3", x: 4, y: 0, type: "crate", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/features/crate.svg", role: "decoration", category: "crate", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crate", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, { id: "crate4", x: 3, y: 7, type: "crate", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/features/crate.svg", role: "decoration", category: "crate", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crate", thumbnailUrl: "" } } ]
        @label "Features"
        @description "Crate barricade drawn on the impassable center cells."
        @tier "presentation"
      assetManifest : AssetManifest = { terrains: { ground: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/terrain/ground.svg", role: "tile", category: "ground", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "ground", thumbnailUrl: "" }, stone: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/terrain/stone.svg", role: "tile", category: "stone", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "stone", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, units: { marine: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/marine.svg", role: "npc", category: "marine", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "marine", thumbnailUrl: "" }, raider: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/units/raider.svg", role: "npc", category: "raider", animations: ["idle", "walk", "attack", "hit", "death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "raider", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, features: { crate: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/features/crate.svg", role: "decoration", category: "crate", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crate", thumbnailUrl: "" } }, effects: { hit: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/effects/hit.svg", role: "effect", category: "hit", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "hit", thumbnailUrl: "" }, explosion: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/effects/explosion.svg", role: "effect", category: "explosion", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "explosion", thumbnailUrl: "" } } }
        @label "Asset Manifest"
        @description "Terrain/unit/feature/effect sprite manifest."
        @tier "presentation"
      projection : string = "flat"
        @label "Projection"
        @description "canvas-2d projection: flat or isometric."
        @tier "presentation"
      showMinimap : boolean = false
        @label "Show Minimap"
        @description "Whether the canvas draws a minimap."
        @tier "presentation"
      backgroundAsset : Asset = { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "ui", thumbnailUrl: "" }
        @label "Background Asset"
        @description "Game-shell background panel sprite (theme chrome)."
        @tier "presentation"
      hudBackgroundAsset : Asset = { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-arena-board/svg/flat/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "ui", thumbnailUrl: "" }
        @label "HUD Background Asset"
        @description "HUD panel background sprite (theme chrome)."
        @tier "presentation"
    }
  }

  page "/arena" as ArenaPage -> TacticsAuthority, FxDecay, RoundLogic, ScoreKeeper, AnimClock, ArenaClock, ArenaCommand
}
